      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.87,
      "end_seconds": 3.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.2,
      "end_seconds": 6.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Hi, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.18,
      "end_seconds": 11.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Start wherever you like, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.78,
      "end_seconds": 19.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "Honestly, uh, it's severe back pain, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.19,
      "end_seconds": 26.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.57,
      "end_seconds": 30.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "No, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.52,
      "end_seconds": 33.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.97,
      "end_seconds": 36.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "I've had it for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.5,
      "end_seconds": 38.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.38,
      "end_seconds": 45.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "And, And there's a fever as well, about four days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.52,
      "end_seconds": 53.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Alright, did you notice any recent fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.28,
      "end_seconds": 57.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "No, no recent fall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.21,
      "end_seconds": 63.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any weight loss or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.88,
      "end_seconds": 69.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "No weight loss or chest pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.43,
      "end_seconds": 73.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Alright, is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.77,
      "end_seconds": 75.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.64,
      "end_seconds": 90.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Okay, what about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.76,
      "end_seconds": 94.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "My grandmother had dementia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.73,
      "end_seconds": 96.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Alright, how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.81,
      "end_seconds": 100.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.68,
      "end_seconds": 102.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.97,
      "end_seconds": 109.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.23,
      "end_seconds": 113.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.01,
      "end_seconds": 118.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.37,
      "end_seconds": 130.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.07,
      "end_seconds": 135.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "No, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.3,
      "end_seconds": 153.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.82,
      "end_seconds": 156.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.58,
      "end_seconds": 162.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.19,
      "end_seconds": 170.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.0,
      "end_seconds": 175.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Okay, I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.56,
      "end_seconds": 184.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.38,
      "end_seconds": 216.51,
      "duration_seconds": 11.13,
      "text": "Okay: height 171 centimetres, BMI works out to 22.2, heart rate 89, BP is 118 over 75, respiratory rate 19, weight 65 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.95,
      "end_seconds": 222.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.13,
      "end_seconds": 225.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.36,
      "end_seconds": 240.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "Your spine is extremely tender at one level and your leg strength is reduced."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.68,
      "end_seconds": 244.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.53,
      "end_seconds": 271.36,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, I think we're dealing with a possible spinal infection pressing on the nerves at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.07,
      "end_seconds": 273.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.85,
      "end_seconds": 314.85,
      "duration_seconds": 36.0,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a possible spinal infection pressing on the nerves, but I'd like to confirm. I'll request an urgent MRI of the spine, it'll help with possible epidural abscess. You are going to hospital now, this can cause permanent weakness. I'll also refer you to the spinal team. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.14,
      "end_seconds": 318.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.9,
      "end_seconds": 325.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.42,
      "end_seconds": 331.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Yeah, um, I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.13,
      "end_seconds": 333.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
